    fix: do not re-propose closed questions. Addresses AUG-056.
    
    Store proposed-question identity against the project's durable question rows. Refuse an exact canonical match only when the prior row is settled and carries a stored decision closure; moot and budget-thin rows remain eligible for propagation semantics.
    
    Verification:
    - RED: the new closed-question regression failed pre-fix by storing Q-000002 after D-001 closed Q-000001.
    - GREEN: targeted regression tests passed (2 passed).
    - GREEN: ask-focused tests passed (20 passed).
    - GREEN: full tests/test_auger.py passed (141 passed, 4 pre-existing unknown-mark warnings).
    - GREEN: ruff check auger.py and py_compile passed.
